                <note rend="inline" type="source">365D.1163/85: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Italy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-06-22T16:00:00-04:00">June 22, 1937—4 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>109. Your 291, June 21, 1 p.m. Please keep Department informed of developments in
                    connection with its telegram No. 102, June 14, 3 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
